nd Netflix, ask",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-7 text-slate-300 sm:text-lg","children":"Before you compare IPTV and Netflix, ask yourself one simple question: when you sit down to watch television, do you usually press play or tune in?"}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-slate-400","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"10 min read"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-slate-600","children":"•"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Updated ",["$","time",null,{"dateTime":"2026-08-04","children":"4 August 2026"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2","children":[["$","span","Feature-by-feature table",{"className":"rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white/90","children":"Feature-by-feature table"}],["$","span","2026 cost breakdown",{"className":"rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white/90","children":"2026 cost breakdown"}],["$","span","Who should choose what",{"className":"rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white/90","children":"Who should choose what"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 shadow-[0_35px_100px_-45px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/images/guides/iptv-vs-netflix.svg","alt":"Live channel guide on one screen and an on demand box set library on another","width":1200,"height":630,"className":"h-auto w-full","fetchPriority":"high"}]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-16","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_270px] lg:gap-14","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"min-w-0","children":[[["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":"If you prefer choosing a film, box set or original series whenever it suits you, Netflix — used by around six in ten UK households — is likely to feel familiar. If you still plan your evening around live television, scheduled channels, catch-up viewing or sport, IPTV may fit the way you watch more naturally."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":"The important thing to remember is that IPTV is simply television delivered through the internet, and its legality depends on whether the provider holds the correct rights to the content it offers. So you are not really choosing a universal winner; you are deciding whether your household needs on-demand entertainment, live television, or a combination of both that could cost less than a traditional pay-TV package."}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"what-netflix-gives","className":"mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"What Netflix Actually Gives You"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":"Netflix earns its place in your home by making an ordinary evening effortless: you open the app, continue the series you started last night, download something for a journey, or let its recommendations rescue you from the familiar \"what should we watch?\" debate. Its biggest originals — Stranger Things, The Crown, Wednesday, Squid Game and Bridgerton — still have the budgets, casts and cultural impact of major television events, while the wider catalogue gives you films, documentaries, international dramas and reliable comfort viewing in one polished app."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":"The limitation appears when you expect Netflix to replace an entire television package. Although it now carries selected live programming such as WWE, boxing, concerts and special events, it does not give you the everyday mix of BBC One, ITV1, rolling news, Sky Sports, TNT Sports or a full weekend of live football. You may never notice that gap if you mainly want a great film or box set waiting when you finally sit down, but if your viewing routine depends on regular live channels and broader sports coverage, Netflix becomes one excellent part of your setup rather than the whole solution."}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"what-iptv-gives","className":"mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"What IPTV Gives You That Netflix Cannot"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":"IPTV gives you something Netflix is not designed to provide: a full live television experience. With a properly licensed service, you can move between live channels, check a programme guide, catch up on missed shows and follow sport without opening several different apps."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":["For football fans, the difference is significant: during the 2026/27 Premier League season, at least 267 of the 380 matches will be shown live in the UK, with Sky Sports carrying at least 215 and TNT Sports showing 52, while Sky remains the UK home of Formula 1. An authorised IPTV package can bring that coverage together with BBC, ITV, Channel 4, Channel 5, regional channels, news, entertainment and an on-demand library — you can see the full ",["$","$L4","1",{"href":"/channels","className":"font-semibold text-orange-600 underline decoration-orange-300 underline-offset-2 transition hover:text-orange-700","children":"IPTV UK channel list"}]," for what that looks like in practice."]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-2xl border px-5 py-4 border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 text-amber-950","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-70","children":"One claim to check carefully"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-6 mt-2","children":"Be careful with providers claiming to show every Premier League match, because Saturday 3pm fixtures remain unavailable for legal broadcast in the UK during the blackout period."}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"at-a-glance","className":"mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"Netflix vs IPTV at a Glance"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6","children":[null,["$","div",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-50px_rgba(15,23,42,0.6)]","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full min-w-[640px] border-collapse text-left text-sm","children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"className":"bg-slate-900 text-white","children":[["$","th","Feature",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]","children":"Feature"}],["$","th","Netflix",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]","children":"Netflix"}],["$","th","IPTV",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]","children":"IPTV"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","Exclusive originals",{"className":"bg-white","children":[["$","td","Exclusive originals-0",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-slate-900","children":"Exclusive originals"}],["$","td","Exclusive originals-1",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Strong selection of Netflix Originals"}],["$","td","Exclusive originals-2",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Depends on the provider’s library"}]]}],["$","tr","Regular live UK channels",{"className":"bg-slate-50","children":[["$","td","Regular live UK channels-0",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-slate-900","children":"Regular live UK channels"}],["$","td","Regular live UK channels-1",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Not included"}],["$","td","Regular live UK channels-2",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Available through authorised packages"}]]}],["$","tr","Premier League coverage",{"className":"bg-white","children":[["$","td","Premier League coverage-0",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-slate-900","children":"Premier League coverage"}],["$","td","Premier League coverage-1",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Not included"}],["$","td","Premier League coverage-2",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Depends on the channels and rights included"}]]}],["$","tr","Catch-up television",{"className":"bg-slate-50","children":[["$","td","Catch-up television-0",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-slate-900","children":"Catch-up television"}],["$","td","Catch-up television-1",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Limited to Netflix content"}],["$","td","Catch-up television-2",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Depends on the provider"}]]}],["$","tr","Offline downloads",{"className":"bg-white","children":[["$","td","Offline downloads-0",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-slate-900","children":"Offline downloads"}],["$","td","Offline downloads-1",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Available"}],["$","td","Offline downloads-2",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Depends on the player and provider"}]]}],["$","tr","Setup",{"className":"bg-slate-50","children":[["$","td","Setup-0",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-slate-900","children":"Setup"}],["$","td","Setup-1",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Download, sign in and watch"}],["$","td","Setup-2",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"May require a player and subscription details"}]]}],["$","tr","Payment",{"className":"bg-white","children":[["$","td","Payment-0",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-slate-900","children":"Payment"}],["$","td","Payment-1",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Monthly"}],["$","td","Payment-2",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Monthly or upfront, depending on the plan"}]]}],["$","tr","Content rights",{"className":"bg-slate-50","children":[["$","td","Content rights-0",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-slate-900","children":"Content rights"}],["$","td","Content rights-1",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Managed directly by Netflix"}],["$","td","Content rights-2",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Should be confirmed with the provider"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"setup","className":"mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"Which Service Is Easier to Set Up?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":["Netflix usually takes only a few minutes to get running: download the app, sign in and choose a profile. IPTV may require a separate player, login details and an electronic programme guide before the channels appear correctly. Some providers complete the setup for you, while others send instructions for you to follow. Check whether your Smart TV, Fire TV Stick, phone or streaming box supports the required player — our ",["$","$L4","1",{"href":"/installation-guide","className":"font-semibold text-orange-600 underline decoration-orange-300 underline-offset-2 transition hover:text-orange-700","children":"device-by-device setup guide"}]," covers the common ones — and ask whether the player carries an additional fee."]}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"trust","className":"mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"Why Netflix Feels Easier to Trust"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":"Netflix earns its advantage when you care less about huge content numbers and more about knowing exactly what will happen after you pay. Your subscription, billing, parental controls, accessibility settings and customer support all sit under one established service, while every Netflix Original has a recognised legal home rather than depending on a reseller, playlist or third-party programme guide. Ofcom found that 26% of viewers name Netflix as their first destination when looking for something to watch. You can change plans, cancel online and use a familiar account experience across supported devices without dealing with a separate reseller."}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"cost","className":"mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"The Real Cost Comparison in 2026"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":"Streaming bills rarely feel expensive at first; they grow one subscription at a time. Netflix currently costs £5.99 with adverts, £12.99 for Standard and £18.99 for Premium, while a flexible NOW Sports Month Membership costs £34.99. Pair Netflix Standard with NOW Sports and you reach £47.98 a month, or £575.76 a year, for Netflix entertainment and access to the Sky Sports channels carried by NOW."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":"Cost pressure is already changing household behaviour: Ofcom found that 13% of Netflix subscribers downgraded during the previous year, with 62% of them moving to the cheaper advert-supported tier."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":["By comparison, our ",["$","$L4","1",{"href":"/pricing","className":"font-semibold text-orange-600 underline decoration-orange-300 underline-offset-2 transition hover:text-orange-700","children":"12-month Ultimate Plan"}]," is £49.99 paid upfront, an effective rate of about £4.17 a month. Adding Netflix Standard brings the average combined cost to roughly £17.16 a month. A low monthly figure only represents genuine value when the promised access remains stable, supported and legally authorised."]}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"both-together","className":"mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"Should You Use IPTV and Netflix Together?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":"You do not need to force everyone in your home into the same viewing routine. One person may follow a Netflix drama while another watches live sport, the evening news or a programme airing at a fixed time. Ofcom reports that 69% of UK households subscribe to at least one of Netflix, Prime Video or Disney+, while 20% pay for all three, showing that using more than one service is already normal. Keeping Netflix and IPTV together makes sense when both are opened regularly and serve different people in your household."}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"who-should-choose","className":"mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"Who Should Choose What?"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3","children":[["$","article","You watch in your own time",{"className":"rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950 to-slate-800 p-5 text-white shadow-[0_25px_70px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.9)]","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-orange-300","children":"Netflix only"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg font-black","children":"You watch in your own time"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300","children":"Films, documentaries and series whenever it suits you, with a familiar app, offline downloads and straightforward billing. Enough on its own when live channels rarely form part of your week."}]]}],["$","article","You watch on a schedule",{"className":"rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950 to-slate-800 p-5 text-white shadow-[0_25px_70px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.9)]","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-orange-300","children":"IPTV only"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg font-black","children":"You watch on a schedule"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300","children":"Scheduled programmes, news, catch-up and regular live broadcasts matter more than Netflix exclusives. Focus on the channels your household genuinely watches rather than a provider’s total channel count."}]]}],["$","article","Your household is split",{"className":"rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950 to-slate-800 p-5 text-white shadow-[0_25px_70px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.9)]","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-orange-300","children":"Both together"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg font-black","children":"Your household is split"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300","children":"Different viewing habits under one roof, with both services used every week. Review both regularly and cancel whichever one spends more time unopened than playing."}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"before-you-subscribe","className":"mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"Before You Subscribe"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":["Before paying for an IPTV plan, confirm the total upfront cost, subscription length and renewal price. Check how many screens can play at the same time, whether the player app costs extra and which channels or catch-up services are included. Read the ",["$","$L4","1",{"href":"/refund","className":"font-semibold text-orange-600 underline decoration-orange-300 underline-offset-2 transition hover:text-orange-700","children":"refund terms"}],", test playback during busy evening hours and ask the provider to explain its content and distribution rights."]}]],["$","section",null,{"id":"faq","className":"mt-14 scroll-mt-24","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"Frequently Asked Questions"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 space-y-3","children":[["$","details","Does IPTV replace Netflix?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Does IPTV replace Netflix?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Not completely. IPTV may cover scheduled channels, catch-up programmes and a separate on-demand library, but Netflix Originals remain tied to Netflix. Check your recent viewing history before cancelling."}]]}],["$","details","Can I watch the Premier League on Netflix?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Can I watch the Premier League on Netflix?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"No. Netflix carries selected live events, but it does not hold UK Premier League rights. Official coverage is available through licensed sports broadcasters. Saturday 3pm matches remain inside the UK broadcast blackout, so claims of authorised access to every fixture should be checked carefully."}]]}],["$","details","Is IPTV cheaper than Netflix?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Is IPTV cheaper than Netflix?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"It can be, but always check how the monthly figure is calculated. Our 12-month Ultimate Plan is £49.99 paid upfront, which works out at roughly £4.17 a month, while the 1-month Starter Plan is £14.99. Netflix starts at £5.99 per month and allows monthly cancellation, so a short IPTV plan and a Netflix subscription can cost about the same."}]]}],["$","details","Do I need a TV Licence for IPTV or Netflix?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Do I need a TV Licence for IPTV or Netflix?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"You need a UK TV Licence when you watch programmes or events live through IPTV, Netflix or another streaming platform. A licence is also required whenever you use BBC iPlayer, including on-demand programmes. You do not need one when you only watch standard on-demand Netflix films and series and never use BBC iPlayer. The same rules apply on televisions, phones, tablets and laptops."}]]}],["$","details","Can I use Netflix and IPTV on the same television?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Can I use Netflix and IPTV on the same television?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Usually, yes. Netflix and an IPTV player can run on the same compatible Smart TV or streaming device. App availability varies between television operating systems, so check whether your device supports the required IPTV player before subscribing. A Fire TV Stick or another streaming device may be needed when the television’s app store does not carry it."}]]}]]